  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation and organization of the Second International Conference on Geographical Indications</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the international conference 2025 is twofold. On the one hand, it will allow discussions dedicated to the latest research, best practices, innovations and cooperation to be deployed in GI, sharing views between universities, professional networks and the political sphere. On the other hand, these discussions will feed into the ways of implementing cooperative actions to follow the G7 2024 priorities. It will therefore be a moment of sharing and reflection with academics, practitioners, policy makers, GI producer organizations and development actors on the current state and future developments of research and initiatives on the ground and at the political level.</narrative>
  </description>
